# MAD vLLM patch for docker/vllm_disagg_inference.glmv5.3_quark_mxfp4_attnfp8.ubuntu.amd.Dockerfile
# What: MoRIIO non-hybrid READ skips the blocks of the decode-side local prefix hit,
#   so a warm multi-turn request reads only the uncached tail instead of the whole
#   prompt KV (full GLM-5.3: MLA + DSA indexer). Cold requests, partial boundary
#   blocks, windowed groups and MTP state are unchanged.
# Upstream: local, not upstream yet (no PR opened).
# Remove when: an equivalent upstream fix is merged and VLLM_REF contains it.
# Note: the commit-message preamble below was reworded for publication; the diff
#   hunks are byte-identical to the tested patch (tested file sha256 7c65a49e...).
# ---- end of MAD header; the patch follows (diff hunks as tested) ----
From: local
Subject: [PATCH] MoRIIO READ: skip blocks of the decode-side local prefix hit (non-hybrid)

Local patch (GLM-5.3 full, MLA + DSA indexer). Applies on 8673602b8b with
patches 0001-0004 and 0006. Not upstream.

